<title>INDONESIA: Riki Dago appointed director at Dharmala Sec.</title>
<headline>Riki Dago appointed director at Dharmala Sec.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Riki Dago has been appointed the broking director of PT Dharmala Securities in Jakarta.</p>
<p>He was associate director of PT Pratama Penagaarta.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
